    description: Some("Two to four cards appear and you guess which one the computer has picked, highlighting it and pressing fire; everything but the correct card then vanishes. First to twenty points wins, and you can pass for a fresh set without losing your turn. Variations switch between pictures and colours, and decide whether the computer chooses before or after you do."),
